==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Eggson is a halved brown, hard boiled egg. The white and yolk of the egg are visible, and he sports a small pair of round glasses with yellow lenses and a gentle smile. He wears a droopy, yellow, lemniscate shaped bow tie, and a striped, buttoned shirt that is colored orange and yellow around the torso, white on the sleeves, and yellow on the cuffs with black buttons. He also wields an orange cane, which has a yellow stripe on it, and a black base. In his Introduction Card, his cane is entirely brown.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Eggson has a gray shell, a light gray white, and white yolk. His eyes are also pie-cut left, seen in his hurt face. Gray-lensed glasses sit on his head, and the yellow and orange on his shirt is swapped with light gray and black respectively and his cuffs and bow tie are light gray. His cane is now dark gray with a light gray stripe.
|-|Painted Patterns=
Painted Patterns Eggson is recolored a light pink color. His shell is painted with three darker pink, wave-like stripes, has a lighter yellow yolk, and bears an expression more like the one on his Introduction Card. The lower part of his legs are decorated with a similar curved stripe and his feet are topped with the same shade of pink. A four-petaled, pointed flower now sits on the right side of his head, colored light blue on the top and bottom and teal on the sides. Similar hues are also featured on his turquoise checkered shirt, as well as his bow tie, cuffs, and glasses with pink lenses. The cane he holds, now without a stripe, is now pastel yellow like his yolk and is white at the base.
|-|Golden Egg=
Golden Egg Eggson is an orange color, with a yellower yolk and white sparkles and spots on the front of his head and the back of his hands. On top of his head is a gold crown with six spikes, a red oval ornamenting each. The bow tie is also now a red and four sided, double loop bow. His cuffs are recolored red, his glasses have red lenses, and his shirt is yellow with a slightly darker stripe above the hem and white sparkles scattered on the front and back. He wears red pants, striped with vertical, lighter red lines and now wears black shoes. His cane appears red with the stripe being slightly lighter shade. He also emits a faint golden glow, along with small yellow twinkles.
|-|Spring-Time=
[[Spring-Time Cosmetic Pack|Spring-Time]] Eggson has a slightly paler shell color and a much paler yolk. His glasses are reskinned to have an olive green frame and pink lenses and his smile includes a small mark on the left. He now wears a pinstriped, sage green, long-sleeve shirt with cream colored buttons and a white, scalloped shirt underneath that pokes out from the cuffs and hem. He wears a bow with teardrop-shaped sides that has a pink, diagonal gingham pattern, alongside pants of the same color and pattern. He also wears a warm brown pair shoes with bright yellow feet bands. His cane is light brown with a soft yellow stripe, a light green base, and a vine adorned with a single leaf, with a lighter line in the middle, now wraps around the cane. He produces semi-visible pink and purple flowers with yellow pistils and green stems that sprout around him and disappear quickly as well as tiny, greenish, pollen-like specks from his torso. When moving, a transparent trail of flowers and leaves colored with a green to pink gradient expands and then fades away.
|-|Still Hip=
Still Hip Eggson is given a lighter toned, yellowish pigment and has a smile line on the left of his grin. He wears a pair of black sunglasses with large, white shines on his forehead. He wears a red tee shirt with an orange and yellow fire pattern and a white, long sleeved undershirt with the collar sticking out. He wears blue jeans with a light blue button and bottom hems. He also wears red sneakers with black laces, a white toe box, and white tongue. Instead of a cane, he possesses a skateboard with black wheels, orange trucks, and a pattern similar to his shirt's. Yellow and orange flame particles generate near him and shrink into nothing.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Eggson is portrayed as the stereotypical elder he is, using phrases such as, "Back in my day," sometimes referring to [[Toons]] as young man/lady or little one, and talks in a refined manner. He is very thoughtful and looks out for others' best interest, checking in on Toons and is pleased to hear when they are happy and taking good care of themselves, even valuing a simple smile as "something of the utmost importance." Considering that he is an elder with lots of wisdom and knowledge, he shares advice and stories of past experiences, especially to Toons who he feels may not be doing their best so they can calm down and feel better.

He typically has his mind on eggs, as seen in various dialogues mentioning eggs, or just saying, "eggs." Even his hobbies consist primarily of activities involving eggs, especially evident in his dialogue with {{CI|Brightney|name=true}}, though he does have standards regarding eggs despite his passion for them, based on his interaction with {{CI|Flutter|name=true}}. Egg hunting is one of his most notable pastimes, being known as the previous Egg Hunt Champion, and hopes to participate in egg hunts every chance he gets, often wondering if eggs are hidden in the [[Elevator]]. He even desperately asks {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} to let him take the eggs out of the fridge so he can hide them for Cosmo to find, despite being rejected every time he requests to do so.

