===Golden Skin Strategies===
*'''For the first quest''', play normally until you see {{CI|Twisted Eggson|name=true}} on the [[Floor]]. Then, either encounter him normally or ask the distractor to bring Twisted Eggson to the Elevator.
*'''For the second quest''', play normally to Floor 5 or 10, complete the floor, then rejoin and do it all over again. Continuous gameplay will waste time as the higher Floors will take longer to complete.
*'''For the third quest''', try and touch every available Machine on the floor. If a Machine is already being extracted by another player, try to ask them to let you tap it with the chat feature or the {{SI|Can I extract?|name=true}} Sticker. Additionally, you can just go to a solo round, tap all Machines, and leave, as that would be a bit quicker.

==Strategies==
Eggson is a balanced [[Toon]], but leans slightly into the role of extractor because of his [[Ability]], '''Fixer Upper''', which fills a [[Machine]] by 20% {{Small|(9 units)}}. While not much of an increase, this isn't forced onto the first Machine you find on the start of the [[Floor]], so you can try extending your Ability to other Machines. The Ability also stacks for multiple Eggsons, useful if you're in a run with at least 5 Eggsons.

What you can do at the start of a Floor is to get to all the Machines you see and activate your Ability. If other Toons reach a Machine before you, you can ask for the Machine, use your Ability, and leave, though if you are asking a high Extraction Speed Toon, this may actually take longer than leaving them be. Additionally, doing a Machine by yourself will generally be much faster and wastes less [[Stamina]] and reduced the risk of you getting seen by other [[Twisteds]] while finding Machines. Therefore, it is much safer and quicker to just do any unoccupied Machine and boost any nearby ones.

You can use his Ability on Machines where slow extractors such as {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, or {{CI|Goob|name=true}} are extracting, making Machines finish much quicker.

The average Machine completion time for Eggson is uniquely 28 seconds, as he only ever has to fill 80% of a Machine (36 units), thanks to his Ability.

Due to his average stat spread, he doesn't have clear deficits nor strength in any of his stats. Support your weaknesses with aiding [[Trinkets]]; be wary of faster moving Twisteds like {{CI|Twisted Pebble|name=true}}, {{CI|Twisted Toodles|name=true}}, and {{CI|Twisted Shelly|name=true}} as your average Stamina and Movement Speed may pose an issue depending on your style of gameplay. If you have trouble with these Twisteds' speeds, using a Trinket like {{TI|Pink Bow|name=true}} may lessen your problems.

