==Trivia==
*Eggson is the only [[Easter]] [[Holiday Toon]] who has no interaction with the [[Christmas]] or [[Halloween]] Holiday Toons.
*Eggson is the second [[Toon]] to not be considered as an unknown adult age, instead being older than all of the others, with the first and third being {{CI|Toodles|name=true}} and {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} respectively, with them being children.
*Eggson shares the same [[Stat]] spread with the starters and other {{Type|Common}} [[Event Toons]] {{Small|(3 {{Star}} in all stats)}}.
*One of his interactions with {{CI|Flyte|name=true}} is a reference to the [[W:C:roblox:Egg hunt|Egg Hunt]] and [[W:C:roblox:The Hunt: First Edition|The Hunt]] events.
**He and [[Dandy]] are the only Toons who break the 4th wall (Dandy in particular directly mentions Robux as a currency).
*Eggson is the second [[Toon]] as of now to speak more than once consecutively in a dialogue, speaking thrice, the first being {{CI|Looey|name=true}}. This occurs in his second dialogue with {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}.
*Eggson has one of the shortest descending dialogues, simply saying: "{{Text|Eggs.}}"
*Prior to [[Changelog|v0.17.1]], Eggson would only complete 10% of a [[Machine]] with his Passive [[Ability]], and for an unknown reason, his Ability did not work on [[Treadmill Machines]]. The latter may have been due to Treadmill Machines coming out after Eggson was released.
**Eggson's Ability would however work on [[Circle Machines]], even though they were also added after his release.
*As seen in the "'''Happy Easter!🌷- Dandy’s World'''" video, Eggson sleeps on a rocking chair. It is likely that this is a common habit of his, and not merely a one-time occurrence, following the common stereotype of old people and rocking chairs.
*Despite being featured in the song [[Wilting]], Eggson and [[Flyte]] do not have any lines.
*Eggson is the only [[Toon]] with a custom idle animation that's exclusive to a [[Skin]], this being the {{Skin|Still Hip}} Skin, where he spins his skateboard instead of fixing his glasses like his default idle.

